WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:06.049
Hey youtubers, Monday in by Game of Thrones
Breakdown I asked you to submit all your questions

00:00:06.049 --> 00:00:08.260
about season 4 and now it’s time for some
answers.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:12.960
If you didn’t see it, I announced the countdown
video series I’ll be starting in March that

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.750
will end with my review of episode 1.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.009
That will also be the beginning of my weekly
game of thrones giveaway.

00:00:20.009 --> 00:00:23.360
It will be just like the one I’m doing for
Walking Dead right now.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.180
If you’re finding me for the first time
be sure to subscribe to participate.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.391
Super happy fun time with dragons starts in
about two weeks so get excited.

00:00:29.391 --> 00:00:31.000
Now let’s get to your questions.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.770
Number 1 - Reyne of Castamere (no avatar)
asks How are they going to explain Jaime returning

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.250
too early to Kingslanding?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.520
and Is Bronn going to accompany Jaime to Riverrun
in order to completely fulfil Ilyn Payne's

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.520
role?

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.620
They’re not going to do anything special.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:48.120
His story will just flow more from the events
of Feast For Crows.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:52.040
There was the twincest shot and then if you’ve
read the books you know how his character

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.040
starts changing.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.040
The Whitecloaks, Brienne and Oathkeeper.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:59.200
And yes, Bronn as seen in the trailer, Bronn
is training him to fight with his left hand.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:09.190
Since the character that plays Illyn Payne
is very sick with cancer they’re just giving

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:10.720
his scenes to Bronn.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:17.880
So there will be exponentially more wisecracking.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:22.110
Question Number 2 - All the world’s a stage
asks how deep into Dance With Dragons Feast

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:26.490
For Crows territory is season 4 pushing with
the characters like Brienne, Danerys, Bran,

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:30.900
and Theon, and what kind of pressure does
this put on GRRM to get "The Winds of Winter"

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:31.900
out there?

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.160
I don’t think it will cover the entire books.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.120
Just like Season 3 didn’t do all of Clash
of Kings.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:39.860
But I’d say based on the footage we’ve
seen they’ll get at least halfway through

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:40.860
books 4 and 5.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:41.860
Just because both those books cover the same
period of time, just with different POV chapters.

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:45.619
The key in determining how far is looking
at the Sansa scenes.

00:01:45.619 --> 00:01:48.920
Because of all the things in the trailer I
think that place she’s in happens after

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.020
that scene with Drogon at the end.

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.820
Question Number 3 - 7th Element asks Do you
think we'll see the Arya Faceless Ones narrative

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:56.580
explored this season?

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:00.021
The coin yes, but there has been no indication
that they filmed scenes in any place that

00:02:00.021 --> 00:02:01.860
they don’t already have sets, with the exception
of Mereen.

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:06.180
So unless northern ireland where they film
the riverlands, crossroads scenes will be

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:17.019
doubling for the next place Arya goes, the
furthest we’ll get is her trying to use

00:02:17.019 --> 00:02:18.019
the coin.

00:02:18.019 --> 00:02:20.930
There’s been no evidence that they’ve
filmed scenes that chronologically occur after

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:21.930
that moment.

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:25.849
I would bet that if they stay true to the
books, the faceless ones will be a season

00:02:25.849 --> 00:02:26.989
5 thing.

00:02:26.989 --> 00:02:30.879
Question Number 4 - Link Carlton (no avatar)
asks how many more seasons realistically do

00:02:30.879 --> 00:02:32.980
you think Game of thrones can go on for?﻿

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:40.629
They’ve plotted 7, but if HBO backs up a
dumptruck of money to their door they’ll

00:02:40.629 --> 00:02:41.629
keep doing it.

00:02:41.629 --> 00:02:42.629
But right now, they’ve tentatively said
they’d like 7 seasons.

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:45.580
Question Number 5 - Svc4Lyf69 (no avatar)
asks Who is or was your favorite character?

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:48.750
My favorite character always changes season
to season.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.420
Last year it was a tie between Jaime and Brienne,
but based on what I know is going to happen

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.420
to his character, Jaime will probably be my
favorite this season.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.269
Seriously, for those who have not read the
books.

00:02:55.269 --> 00:02:57.840
Keep your eyes peeled on Jaime, he only gets
more interesting as the story progresses.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:02.059
Question Number 6 - Mia Picoult asks In what
episode do you think the purple wedding will

00:03:02.059 --> 00:03:03.599
be in?

00:03:03.599 --> 00:03:05.900
Based on what I said in my breakdown and the
actors saying the wedding and the banquet

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:09.730
take up the entire story of one single episode,
I’d say number 4.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:10.949
But it could be sooner.

00:03:10.949 --> 00:03:12.669
It definitely won’t be the first episode.

00:03:12.669 --> 00:03:15.749
And it will definitely be before Episode 5
and 6.

00:03:15.749 --> 00:03:21.109
Question Number 7 - living like lannisters
asks do any book readers have an idea of what

00:03:21.109 --> 00:03:23.150
that scene with Drogon is?

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:30.260
If you have Dance with Dragons, it’s the
scene that comes before this man brings Dany

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.260
a sack of bones.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.480
This is from Chapter 11.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.900
George RR Martin didn’t write that drogon
scene in the book.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.829
We just learned about it from this old man.

00:03:36.829 --> 00:03:41.939
So the show added it in, maybe just for the
sake of seeing drogon NOM an entire person.

00:03:41.939 --> 00:03:46.219
Remember he only roasted someone last year,
but he’ll be big enough to flat out eat

00:03:46.219 --> 00:03:47.450
someone this season.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:52.269
Question Number 8 - Jessica Chaidee asks Do
you think we will see Lady Stoneheart in season

00:03:52.269 --> 00:03:54.849
4?

00:03:54.849 --> 00:04:01.019
The actress who would be playing her was on
suits for all of last year and has starred

00:04:01.019 --> 00:04:04.180
in at least 4 movies since she left game of
thrones.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.269
So there has been no evidence that she was
in northern ireland filming scenes.

00:04:08.269 --> 00:04:12.150
Based on my earlier comment, that they’d
only get part way through books 4 and 5, it’s

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:23.030
possible that she could be in season 5 though.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:28.660
Question Number 9 - Scarlett Moriarty asks
What scenes are you most excited for?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:36.660
Big dragons, Jaime in Kings Landing and arya
and the hound in the riverlands.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:39.910
Of all the characters that go through changes,
the biggest are the dragons.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:45.130
They literally become a huge problem, Jaime
gets so much more interesting and Arya gets

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.130
super dark.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:49.200
Plus I love the odd couple that she and the
hound make.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.230
Their scenes are so much fun to watch.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:56.100
Question Number 10 - yoda super fani (no avatar)
asks Do you post any character reviews?

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:01.540
I’ll be doing a month long count down video
series.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.940
Since there will be so many Game of Thrones
videos happening in that time I’ll definitely

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:09.570
be doing character videos, history videos,
all kinds of stuff based on what you guys

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:10.570
want to see.

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:14.230
I know it will start in about two weeks, so
once we get closer I’ll start scheduling

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.470
