00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:20.790
If you have specific things you want to see
anyone can just let me know in the comments

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.610
and I’ll add it to my list.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:26.450
Bonus Question The Mangese asks How close
to the book do you think the wedding scene

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.090
will be?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.700
They went all out, Charles Dance who plays
Tywin said it felt like a short film it was

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:32.700
so complex.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.530
So I would say they spared no expense and
bit of story.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:37.380
Everyone keeps asking about dwarf jousting.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:43.130
There will definitely be dwarves, but the
jousting bit is still a mystery.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:48.580
Thanks so much everyone for submitting questions,
this was a lot of fun as always.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.050
Remember the countdown videos start in about
two weeks, but until then I’ll probably

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.670
